# =====================================================================
# Release V151 -- clean up retired-T11 Test rows that referenced the dropped Fact_Invoice_Items
# =====================================================================
# V150 dropped Gold.Fact_Invoice_Items, but the retired T11 regression suite still defined 14 metric
# rows querying it (row count, total/nhs/private revenue, 8 FK-null checks, patients-with-discount) plus
# 9 comparison rows referencing those metrics. Tenant 11 no longer exists and deploys run -SkipTests, so
# these never executed -- but they named a dropped table. Removed them and renormalised the leading-comma
# VALUES lists (first row no comma, rest comma; verified balanced). Kept the INVITEM-named rows that
# actually read Gold.Fact_Invoices (Date_Due / Date_Paid FK-null) and the ACTUALS_* metrics that read
# Gold.Fact_Metric_Actuals -- both still valid.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V151__cleanup_retired_t11_invoice_items_tests.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Test.Metric_Definition.Data.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Test.Comparison_Definition.Data.sql

TEST
